# Stowed tools in the HUD model (docs/design/ready-and-stowed-tools.md Phase B):
# the belt's tools are stowed while the hands are full, and back once they're empty.
# Raft scene: three seeds lie on the islet east of the spawn.

case the tools are stowed while carrying and back after dropping
start walk raft
click
lock
expect hud.stowed = false
press Digit3
frame 50 x2
mouse 632 120
frame 50 x2
button down right
button up right
frame 50 x2
expect hud.hands = seeds
expect hud.stowed = true
press KeyQ
frame 50 x2
expect hud.hands = none
expect hud.stowed = false
expect hud.ready = hoe

case a belt key while carrying moves the selection and pulses the hands frame
start walk raft
click
lock
press Digit3
frame 50 x2
mouse 632 120
frame 50 x2
button down right
button up right
frame 50 x2
expect hud.hands = seeds
expect hud.pulse = 0
press Digit2
frame 50
expect hud.selected = 1
expect hud.stowed = true
expect hud.pulse > 0
frame 50
expect hud.pulse > 0
expect hud.pulse < 1
frame 50 x10
expect hud.pulse = 0
expect hud.selected = 1

case a belt key with empty hands does not pulse
start walk raft
click
lock
expect hud.hands = none
press Digit2
frame 50
expect hud.selected = 1
expect hud.pulse = 0
press Digit3
frame 50 x2
expect hud.selected = 2
expect hud.pulse = 0
